From: Peter M. <petermm@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Align ESP32-S31 modem clocks, PHY lifecycle and SMP critical sections

Use specific ESP-IDF clock dependencies and first-enable PHY calibration.
Preserve per-hart PMA mappings, apply the S31 peripheral access workaround,
and provide recursive SMP-safe Wi-Fi/PHY/I2C critical sections in IRAM.

