- * plus the PHY lifecycle. C3/C5/C6 calibration runs on first PHY enable, with
+ * plus the PHY lifecycle. C3/C5/C6/S31 calibration runs on first PHY enable, with
  * wakeup and periodic tracking thereafter, matching esp_phy_enable().
  *
  * What this file does NOT do, so nobody looks for it here:
